en in order to change the frequency, but the library was using a SPI writing function that checked for overwrites. If the LSB did not change, the new frequency would be written in successfully, but the frequency would stay at the module's default.\r\n\r\nI changed it to use the lower level SPI writing function with no overwrite protection if there was no difference between the old and new contents for the LSB.\r\n\r\nI have this commit working on my RFM96W board connected to an Arduino Nano Every, but I have not tested on any other platforms.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-01-03T16:57:24Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T18:11:40Z","closed_at":"2025-01-03T18:11:29Z","merged_at":"2025-01-03T18:11:29Z","merge_commit_sha":"680e88c7394a103e1fe9f1b1fe057e36a2c54d3d","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"CrispyAlice2:master","ref":"master","repo":{"id":911704763,"node_id":"R_kgDONleCuw","name":"RadioLib","full_name":"CrispyAlice2/RadioLib","owner":{"login":"CrispyAlice2","id":73314488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMzE0NDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73314488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CrispyAlice2","html_url":"https://github.com/CrispyAlice2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CrispyAlice2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CrispyAlice2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CrispyAlice2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CrispyAlice2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CrispyAlice2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CrispyAlice2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CrispyAlice2/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CrispyAlice2/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CrispyAlice2/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type